{
  "_readme": [
    "Layered custom-odds config. Copy to 'gacha_odds.json' (same folder) to",
    "activate; delete/rename to fall back to the plain master.mdb rates.",
    "Hot-reloaded on save (mtime check) -- no server restart needed.",
    "Full format doc: server/CONFIG_GUIDE.md, section 'Gacha odds'.",
    "",
    "Top-level keys select BANNERS:  '30111' exact id | '301*' id prefix |",
    "'*' every banner.  Keys starting with '_' are ignored (comments).",
    "",
    "Precedence per banner (later layers win, per key / per card):",
    "  master defaults -> '*' -> prefix sections (file order) -> exact id",
    "",
    "Section keys (all optional):",
    "  on            true = force the banner into gacha/index, false = hide",
    "                it and refuse pulls. IMPORTANT: while this file exists,",
    "                banners nothing matches default to their master",
    "                start/end dates (~18 in window) -- keep '*': {'on': true}",
    "                if you want every banner listed like before.",
    "  rarity_rates  {'1': pct, '2': pct, '3': pct} tier-first draw rates",
    "                replacing the real 79/18/3. Unspecified tiers keep their",
    "                default share; values are normalized, so they need not",
    "                sum to 100. The force_ssr_rate knob in client_config.json",
    "                still wins over this while set (testing back-compat).",
    "  custom_odds   ordered list of {'items': SELECTOR, 'weight': VALUE};",
    "                the LAST entry to match a card decides its weight.",
    "                SELECTOR: '30052' exact card | '1*'/'2*'/'3*' all cards",
    "                of that RARITY | '3011*' card-id prefix | '*' every",
    "                card | or a LIST of selectors (any-of).",
    "                VALUE: number (absolute weight, relative within the",
    "                pool/tier) | 'weightR'/'weightSR'/'weightSSR' (this",
    "                pool's average master weight for that band) | 'x2',",
    "                'x0.5', ... (multiplier on the card's MASTER weight).",
    "",
    "The example below: every banner visible; all 30xxx banners get a 10%",
    "SSR tier; on 30111 specifically the SSR tier is 6% and inside it card",
    "30052 takes ~97% of SSR pulls (weight 99 vs 1 for the other SSRs),",
    "while SR 20048 is doubled. Note how the '3*'-then-'30052' order makes",
    "the pickup work: later entries override earlier ones per card."
  ],

  "*": { "on": true },

  "30*": {
    "rarity_rates": { "3": 10 }
  },

  "30111": {
    "on": true,
    "rarity_rates": { "1": 76, "2": 18, "3": 6 },
    "custom_odds": [
      { "items": "1*",    "weight": "weightR" },
      { "items": "3*",    "weight": 1 },
      { "items": "30052", "weight": 99 },
      { "items": "20048", "weight": "x2" }
    ]
  }
}
